			"kind": "instrument-calibration",
			"status": "PROPOSED — not appended to decisions.json, not applied to config.py",
			"closes": "PHASE_0_LOOSE_ENDS.md A6 (the area guard's group scoping)",
			"decision": "The area guard is scoped OFF for person_like and stays ON for every other group. The census asked all 6 person_like regions over the guard whether they are a real thing filling the cover; all 6 came back real-subject (share 1.000, >= 0.7), none whole-image, none loose. 5 of the 6 also clear the score cut, which is exactly the set the guard deletes on its own corpus-wide, and the reviewer called all 5 correct person masks.",
