		{
			"id": "d-2026-08-04-sam-text-like-cut-discards-correct-text-on-a12-covers",
			"kind": "measurement",
			"status": "PROPOSED — funds a finding, NOT a new constant",
			"decision": "On the A12 hard-text class the text_like cut of 0.697295 discards correct text: 22 of 23 decided below-cut masks are correct, an accept rate of 95.7%, and every one of the 24 graded masks scores at or below 0.576 — below the pooled cut of 0.578 as well as the group cut. Both cuts keep 0 of 24. The reviewer's yes/no boundary does not sit near either cut; it sits at the run-time floor.",
